# =============================================================================
# Stage 5d-quinquies: AP-1 Stress Signature Validation
# =============================================================================
# Validates that AP-1/stress response activation marks progression-prone cells
# and niches. Key biological insight from Marjanovic et al.:
#   - AP-1 (JUN/FOS) marks plastic, high-plasticity state
#   - Associated with fetal progenitor-like intermediate
#   - JNK/ERK/p38 stress pathways converge on AP-1
#   - Links to IL1B signaling (H1.2 connection)
#
# Analyzes both single-cell and spatial transcriptomics:
#   - Single-cell: AP-1 score correlates with progression
#   - Spatial: AP-1 hotspots enriched in early stages

