#   - SASP creates feedforward loops via IL6, GDF15, matrix remodeling
#   - cGAS-STING pathway drives chronic inflammatory cytokine production
#   - Connects to H1.2 (IL1B in SASP) and AP-1 (p38 convergence)
#
# Analyzes both single-cell and spatial data

